---
interface Props {
  photoCount: number;
}

const { photoCount } = Astro.props;
---

<header class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-lg pb-space-lg">
  <div class="flex flex-col max-w-2xl">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm mb-space-sm">
      <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary tracking-widest uppercase">
        Visual Archive · Vol. 04 / Multi-Verse
      </span>
      <span class="w-8 h-px bg-on-surface-variant/30"></span>
      <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">ACG · Lens · Digital World</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-space-md flex-wrap">
      <h1 class="font-display text-primary tracking-tight text-display-mobile sm:text-display">视觉灵感</h1>
      <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface-variant italic font-normal">
        Aperture &amp; Pixels
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="font-quote text-quote text-on-surface-variant mt-space-sm leading-relaxed">
      穿行在二次元唯美画幅、现实快门光影与虚拟CG世界之间。收集打破边界的想象力与真实心动，在此汇成视界灵感馆。
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-start md:items-end self-start md:self-auto">
    <div class="bg-surface-container-high/70 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-space-md shadow-sm max-w-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-primary mb-1">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary">collections_bookmark</span>
        <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">
          Curated Mediums · 媒介馆藏
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant leading-snug">
        动漫插画
        <span class="text-outline-variant">·</span> 现实胶卷/数码
        <span class="text-outline-variant">·</span> 3D概念与虚幻引擎
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs mt-space-xs pt-space-xs text-on-surface-variant/80">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
        <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">{photoCount} 组跨界视觉灵感收录持续更新</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
